OL,3,GNEWSAPolice block Orange Order from
OL,4,Acontroversial parade route
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police prevented the Orange Order
OL,7,Ffrom making a controversial parade down
OL,8,Fa road which had been previously been
OL,9,Fblocked by protesters.
OL,11,FA group of men tried to march from
OL,12,FDrumcree Church down the Garvaghy Road
OL,13,Fin Portadown in the early hours of
OL,14,FMonday but a line of police Land Rovers
OL,15,Fstood in the way.
OL,17,FThey had been unable to make the
OL,18,Fpermitted parade on Sunday morning
OL,19,Fbecause protesters had gathered on the
OL,20,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
