OL,3,GNEWSAPolice block Orange Order from
OL,4,Acontroversial parade route
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein First Minister Michelle
OL,7,FO'Neill joined the protest, prompting
OL,8,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) leader
OL,9,FGavin Robinson to accuse her of acting
OL,10,Funlawfully.
